{"id": "1551522812190007326", "channel_id": "1326453691527594035", "author_id": "332573289438380032", "author_name": "moyashi0672", "content": "Basically, when arachne got released, her exalt could PUT SOMEONE INVINCIBLE, while buffed by that exalt, their damages could BYPASS BARRIER + SHIELD AND DIRECTLY ATTACK HP in form of delayed damages so it could also counter gateway posse ( it was one of the best posse before nerf) and any death trigger oriented wheels, only counter to bypass invincibility were poison / sacrifice trigger cards from nymph or gmurphy.\n\nThen, feast of decay posse, it wasn't written in the description but when you kill and ally with it you could share their alienus too.\n\nThat team setup could make helot regen helot's alienus from 0 to 100 in 1 turn, just needed the setup, it was constant one shot turn 2 or 3 team btw", "timestamp": "2026-09-21T09:17:44.326000+00:00", "type": 19, "mentions": ["1419260513954562098"], "attachments": [{"id": "1551522811254931556", "filename": "InShot_20260427_102203734.mp4", "content_type": "video/mp4", "size": 25509217, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1326453691527594035/1551522811254931556/InShot_20260427_102203734.mp4?ex=6ab247b8&is=6ab0f638&hm=e89ea46adc9bd7cbfc31dde2343e4b6f767120f477d72e56863b8251370cf4ff&"}], "reply_to": "1551413109015580824"}
